  "schema:description": "We have sequenced wildtype and mutant heart, liver, lung, and hindlimb from E14.5 embryos of the mutant lncRNA strain Trp53cor1tm1.1Vlcg (lincp21), and performed a massively parallel reporter assay (MPRA) in mouse myoblast cells (C2C12). Comparison between wildtype and mutant organ transcriptomes in the Trp53cor1tm1.1Vlcg strain. Additionally, we include a comparison between MPRA signal vector tag distributions and C2C12 tag distributions.",
  "schema:distribution": [
    {
      "@type": [
        "schema:DataDownload"
      ],
      "schema:contentUrl": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE73472"
    }
  ],
